			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Migrate std::sync::Mutex to parking_lot::Mutex and modernize lazy static initialization\n\nReplace standard library mutexes with parking_lot::Mutex across terminal state management, IPC connection pools, secure message channels, performance dashboard, and Cocoon process management. The parking_lot implementation provides faster lock acquisition and doesn't return Result from lock() (panics on poison instead), simplifying error handling throughout the codebase.\n\nSimultaneously replace lazy_static macros with once_cell::sync::Lazy for global registry initialization (feature flags, metrics, Cocoon state), adopting the more modern and maintenance-friendly pattern.\n\nKey changes:\n- TerminalState and TerminalStateDTO: Arc<Mutex<>> replaces Arc<StandardMutex<>> for PTY handles and terminal collections\n- TerminalProvider: Output buffer and terminal map locks simplified; removed MapLockErrorToCommonError mappings\n- ErrorMapping: Added WithParkingLotMutex helper for the new locking pattern\n- IPC Enhanced modules: ConnectionPool, MessageCompressor, PerformanceDashboard, SecureMessageChannel all updated\n- CocoonManagement: lazy_static replaced with once_cell::Lazy for COCOON_STATE and COCOON_HEALTH\n- Telemetry registries: FeatureFlags and Metrics global registries migrated to once_cell::Lazy\n- Vine client/server notification shims: Minor formatting normalization\n\nImpact: Reduced lock contention overhead, cleaner error handling paths (no more .ok().and_then() chains for mutex access), and modernized static initialization across Mountain's core subsystems.",
			"SHA": "3b0c95e2986ddeebe6dfa24f4e7a1652a0d5d670"
