			"Message": "style(Mountain): Clean up formatting and whitespace across core modules\n\nApply consistent formatting improvements across Mountain's application state, extension registry, file system effects, and gRPC service:\n\n- ExtensionRegistry: Condense WithCommands/GetCommands implementations, inline dev_log calls, remove excess whitespace\n- FeatureState: Move std::sync imports to module top, fix Default implementation formatting\n- Entry: Fix type annotation spacing for AppStateArcForClosure\n- FileSystem: Reformat base64 decode error handling, align comment wrapping\n- CreateEffectForRequest: Expand Try! macro arms for readability, wrap long comment lines\n- MountainVinegRPCService: Reflow cancellation warning comment, inline CreateErrorResponse call\n\nNo functional changes — purely mechanical formatting cleanup for consistency.",
